  "question": {
    "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> are converted to monopositive cations <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> and <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> respectively. Which set is having correct statements?<br />\r<math><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math> In <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> , paramagnetism decreases<br />\r<math><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math> <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> becomes diamagnetic<br />\r<math><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math> In <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> , the bond order increases<br />\r<math><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo></math> In <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> the <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> bond is weakened."
