  "solution": {
    "text": "M.O. configuration of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is<br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mtext>1s</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi><mtext>1s</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mtext>2s</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi><mtext>2s</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>p</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>p</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>p</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />B.O. of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />M.O. configuration of <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> is<br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mtext>1s</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi><mtext>1s</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mtext>2s</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi><mtext>2s</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>p</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>p</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>p</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />B.O. of <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2.5</mn></math><br />Hence, <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> becomes paramagnetic so statement 2 is incorrect<br />M.O. of configuration of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is<br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mtext>1s</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi><mtext>1s2</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mtext>2s</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi><mtext>2s</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>p</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>p</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>p</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>p</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>p</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />So B.O. of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>–</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />M.O. configuration of <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> is<br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mtext>1s</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi><mtext>1s</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mtext>2s</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi><mtext>2s</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>p</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>p</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>p</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>p</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />B.O. of <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo>